---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "@notionglaze/ui/Layout.astro";
---
export const prerender = true;

<Layout title="Refund Policy | NotionGlaze">
    <main class="legal-container">
        <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: January 24, 2026</p>

        <section>
            <h2>1. Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
            <p>
                We want you to be completely satisfied with NotionGlaze. If you
                are not satisfied with your purchase, you may request a full
                refund within <strong>14 days</strong> of your initial purchase date.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>2. Eligibility for Refunds</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    The request is made within 14 days of the initial
                    subscription start date.
                </li>
                <li>
                    The subscription has not been significantly utilized to
                    engage in abusive behavior (e.g. spamming).
                </li>
                <li>
                    Refunds are generally not available for monthly renewal
                    charges if you failed to cancel before the renewal date,
                    unless required by local law.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>3. How to Request a Refund</h2>
            <p>
                To request a refund, please contact our support team at <a
                    href="mailto:contact@notionglaze.cc"
                    >contact@notionglaze.cc</a
                > with your transaction ID or the email associated with your account.
                Alternatively, you can utilize the Paddle.com self-service links provided
                in your purchase confirmation email.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>4. Processing Time</h2>
            <p>
                Once approved, refunds typically take 5-10 business days to
                appear on your original payment method. This duration depends on
                your bank or credit card issuer.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>5. Cancellations</h2>
            <p>
                You can cancel your subscription at any time from your dashboard
                billing settings. Upon cancellation, your premium access will
                continue until the end of the current billing cycle, after which
                your account will revert to the free/trial state or be paused.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>6. Merchant of Record</h2>
            <p>
                Our order process is conducted by our online reseller
                Paddle.com. Paddle.com is the Merchant of Record for all our
                orders. Paddle handles all returns and refund processing
                directly in accordance with this policy.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
        font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--foreground);
    }

    .last-updated {
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    section {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--foreground);
    }

    p {
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    ul {
        margin-left: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--muted-foreground);
    }

    li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    a {
        color: var(--primary);
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
